---

## 📊 Quick Reference Table

| # | Frequency | Type | Key Fields |
|---|-----------|------|------------|
| 1 | Once | 1 | `onceDate` |
| 2 | Daily | 2 | `daysOfWeek` (1-7) |
| 3 | Weekly | 3 | `daysOfWeek` (1-7) |
| 4 | Monthly | 4 | `datesOfMonth`, `isLastDayOfMonth` |
| 5 | Quarterly | 5 | `months` (1-12), `daysOfMonth` (1-31) |
| 6 | Yearly | 6 | `months` (1-12), `daysOfMonth` (1-31) |
| 7 | Custom | 7 | `intervalDays` |

---

## 📝 Important Notes for Frontend

### Day of Week Mapping
| Value | Day |
|-------|-----|
| 1 | Monday |
| 2 | Tuesday |
| 3 | Wednesday |
| 4 | Thursday |
| 5 | Friday |
| 6 | Saturday |
| 7 | Sunday |

### Month Mapping
| Value | Month |
|-------|-------|
| 1 | January |
| 2 | February |
| ... | ... |
| 12 | December |

### Time Format
- Format: `HH:mm` (24-hour)
- Examples: `09:00`, `10:30`, `14:45`, `23:59`
- **Required** for all frequency types

### Required Fields
| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `type` | int | Frequency type (1-7) |
| `time` | string | Time in HH:mm format |
| Frequency-specific fields | varies | See examples above |

